#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/mount-from-other-os.rst:116
#: d0ffba5c68a441c8844df727ea846072
msgid ""
"Mount the disk using the command ``mount /dev/other_install/<lv name> "
"<mountpoint>``. *Note:* Any compromised data which exists in the volume to "
"be mounted will be accessible here. Do not mount untrusted partitions in "
"dom0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/mount-from-other-os.rst:122
#: 65e9a0648254444f9c7e4c093f769266
msgid "At this point, all files are available in the chosen mountpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/mount-from-other-os.rst:125
#: ec88c7c9441a4467bb07a9cd85c35a16
msgid "Reverting Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/mount-from-other-os.rst:128
#: 141f03703c52413bb24366414d5d0905
msgid ""
"Any changes which were made to the system in the above steps will need to be "
"reverted before the disk will properly boot. However, LVM will not allow a "
"VG to be renamed to a name already in use. Thes steps must occur either in "
"an app qube or using recovery media."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/mount-from-other-os.rst:130
#: 5a6827cba6934b2f864c68f6b7ae2c94
msgid "Unmount any disks that were accessed."
msgstr ""

